<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian new vehicle sales up 18.8 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Australian new vehicle sales up 18.8 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle sales rose 18.8 percent in June, and sales in the first six months of 1997 are 6.2 percent above sales for the same period for 1996, the Federal Chamber of Automotive Industries (FCAI) said.</p>
<p>That strength has seen the FCAI lift its 1997 forecast for full year sales to 660,000 from 640,000 previously.</p>
</text>
